    "text": "By Nik DeCosta-Klipa ,\n1 days ago Editor's Note: This is an excerpt from WBUR's daily morning newsletter, WBUR Today. If you like what you read and want it in your inbox, sign up here. Watch out for the big flatbed truck carrying Nova Scotia's \"Tree for Boston\" on the highway. It's expected to arrive on Boston Common later this morning, kicking off over two weeks of local holiday tree, trellis and ship lighting events. For those feeling festive early or just looking to shake those winter blues, here's look at the schedule: Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
